        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-21T06:19:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If it's in play and then moves to the trash it's destroyed, if it's in your hand and it moves to the trash that's discarded.</p><p>So Omnitron's \"destroy all equipment in play\" is destroy, and the police live on to fight another day.</p>",
